---

A note on accuracy: The *Envoy* addressed to "Vache" survives in only one manuscript (the "Envoy to Vache" in MS Additional 10340), and individual word forms (e.g., *sothfastnesse/stedfastnesse*, *thanne/than*) differ among the manuscript witnesses. If you need a specific critical edition (such as the Riverside Chaucer), I'd recommend consulting that source directly to confirm the exact editorial spellings.
